  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for the Establishment of Tajikistan Textile Technology Training and Research Institute(2025-2029/US$8Mil)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment and operation of Textile Technology Center, Empowerment of textile advanced technical manpower, Active Textile Technology Center industry-academia activities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the project is to establish the Textile Technology Center to foster engineers of high-technological textile to enhance productivity in the textile industry, increase foreign exports in Tajikistan. This can be achieved by educating and supplying high-quality engineers who are capable of operation and maintenance of new technologies and/or modernized equipment at the Textile Technology Center built in the Technological University of Tajikistan&#xD0C0;&#xC9C0;&#xD0A4;&#xC2A4;&#xD0C4; &#xC12C;&#xC720;&#xAE30;&#xC220; &#xC0DD;&#xD0DC;&#xACC4; &#xD655;&#xC7A5;</narrative>
  </description>
